WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.724 --> 00:00:07.493
*Magical music*

00:00:07.571 --> 00:00:09.069
I am Hope!

00:00:09.069 --> 00:00:14.947
And I have chosen the Georgia Bulldogs to bestow my favor upon this College Football season.

00:00:15.257 --> 00:00:17.589
Open your heart and embrace me!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.637
*spray sounds resonating Georgia announcers not being able to pronounce Tua's name before the throw*

00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:26.564
Uhhhh ahhhhh!

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.457
So. Sandwiches?

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:33.454
So explain to me what your problem with hope is again?

00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:36.846
I mean the Bulldogs have 13 returning starters this year.

00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:37.788
14 actually.

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:39.754
You're coming off the #1 recruiting class in the country.

00:00:39.754 --> 00:00:40.544
Yup.

00:00:40.544 --> 00:00:41.535
Kirby has a good staff.

00:00:41.535 --> 00:00:42.263
The best really.

00:00:42.263 --> 00:00:44.255
He even has Muschamp as an intern.

00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:45.739
Seems pretty exciting.

00:00:46.156 --> 00:00:47.254
So what's the problem?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.273
Oh...uh....ok...ok ok.

00:00:51.273 --> 00:00:54.946
That was for 2017. I get it. I get it. I do.

00:00:54.946 --> 00:01:00.927
But now that we've gotten that out of our system we can move on and move forward...

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:03.025
Uhhh ahhdgggghhh!

00:01:06.762 --> 00:01:08.762
You see as a Georgia fan, she's burned me before.

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:10.319
She mentioned 2017

00:01:11.808 --> 00:01:15.097
What she didn't mention was 2018 Jalen Hurts off the bench.

00:01:15.097 --> 00:01:19.577
2007, we waste Knowshon Moreno's breakout season by losing to two unranked teams.

00:01:19.577 --> 00:01:23.298
2004, pre-season ranked #1. That didn't work out!

00:01:23.298 --> 00:01:25.919
2008, Lord Saban has arrived.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:32.595
2012, we're five yards short from getting the honor of crushing a terrible Notre Dame team in the national championship!

00:01:32.595 --> 00:01:33.187
Wow.

00:01:33.187 --> 00:01:34.827
Yeah. And I could go on.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:36.009
But THIS season.

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:38.191
Wait wait wait!!

00:01:39.121 --> 00:01:43.232
This year you get a full season of a healthy J.T. Daniels.

00:01:43.232 --> 00:01:47.019
You get Arick Gilbert and Derion Kendrick out of the transfer portal!

00:01:47.019 --> 00:01:52.000
And you don’t draw Alabama, LSU, or Texas A&amp;M out of the west!

00:01:52.794 --> 00:01:55.501
And I'm really excited and I'll probably watch every game.

00:01:56.111 --> 00:02:06.526
 But nothing will ever change the fact that as a Georgia fan, I’m constantly physically and emotionally prepared to lose to some random non-bowl eligible South Carolina team again and again.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:13.172
Agggghhh!

